data: {"id": "ea24139a961349b0-thinking-layer-223", "run_id": "ea24139a961349b0", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `workload` 处于 `Pending` 状态，且 `NOMINATED NODE` 和 `IP` 均为空，这通常意味着调度器尚未成功将其调度到任何节点，或者调度条件尚未满足。根据 Pod 的异常状态 `Pending`，最相关的诊断手册是 `pod-pending-unschedulable.md`，用于区分资源不足、taint/toleration、nodeSelector/affinity 等调度问题。\n\n我将获取该 Runbook 以指导后续的诊断步骤。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789110814997}

