data: {"id": "ea24139a961349b0-thinking-parallel_evidence-4072", "run_id": "ea24139a961349b0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已经获得了完整的信息：\n\n## 采集到的事实\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`workload` 当前处于 **Pending** 状态（未调度到任何节点）。\n2. **资源请求异常**：Pod 的内存请求量为 **1,125,899,906,842,624 bytes ≈ 1 PiB**（Pebibyte）。\n3. **集群节点可分配内存**：\n   - master: 33,542,696,960 bytes ≈ **31.25 GiB**\n   - node1: 33,542,688,768 bytes ≈ **31.25 GiB**\n   - node2: 16,658,104,320 bytes ≈ **15.5 GiB**\n4. **调度失败事件**：`default-scheduler` 报错 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory`，且无 preemption 候选。\n\n## 结论\n\n**根因已确认**：Pod `aiops-case-v02/workload` 处于 Pending 状态，是因为其 memo", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789110909605, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

